<editorial_guidelines>

- blocks[].points are editor notes, not prose.
- Each point must be a short fragment:
  - 5–14 words
  - no full sentences
  - no semicolons

- Avoid meta verbs such as:
  - “Introduce”
  - “Explain”
  - “Highlight”
  - “Summarize”

- Favor concrete reasoning, tradeoffs, or observable effects
  over labels, categories, or vague descriptors.

- blocks define the rhetorical shape of the section.
  Junior must render blocks in order without re-structuring.

</editorial_guidelines>
